        "TileImage": "$($repository b2cdf231-2bd5-40bb-aa22-789884c16cae).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rtoday, our client is a member of Don Yates&apos; security force. he has been implicated at the centre of a recent scandal, and is due to appear in court in a few days. he has requested that you eliminate Valentina Yates, and 4 of her security detail, as they will likely testify against our client. discretion is advised.\r\rGood luck, Agent.\rDiana.",
